# Workspace scale hardening (Phase I)

Phase I hardens **runtime scale** for the manifest-driven workspace platform: bounded cost for **dynamic theme CSS imports** and a coherent **plugin/registry load cache** in dev and production builds. Phase G (codegen modular) and Phase H (production certification) are **closed on `DEV`** — Phase I does not change manifest authority or certification tiers.

**Authority:** [platform-architecture-v2.md § Phase I](../architecture/platform-architecture-v2.md#phase-i--scale-hardening) · **Theming ingress:** [p6-enterprise-theming-architecture.mdoc](../phase-19/p6-enterprise-theming-architecture.mdoc) · **Codegen host:** [workspace-registry-codegen-modularization.mdoc](./workspace-registry-codegen-modularization.mdoc)

